+## 2026-11-02
+- **Each payment in the books now matches one transfer** ([#64](https://github.com/trysarathy/investigation-desk/pull/64)).
+  When an invoice is paid in several transfers, Clearline posts one payment per transfer. Until now a
+  payment could be a cent different from the transfer it came from (two transfers of 333.335 USDC posted
+  as 333.33 and 333.34), which made the wallet statement and the books hard to tick off line by line.
+  Each payment is now that transfer's own value rounded to the cent. Nothing to do; payments already
+  posted are not changed.
+
 ## 2026-11-01
